# PX4 v1.17 partial QGC overlay for INDOOR flight, no GPS, no RC (SYS_HITL=0).
# Aircraft: 3S1P LiPo, 4x SunnySky X2212 980 kV, Holybro PM07 v2.3, Pixhawk 6C, Raspberry Pi 5.
# Position: MicoAir MTF-01 (optical flow + ToF range) on TELEM3, MAVLink, 115200 baud.
# Companion: Pi 5 on Pixhawk USB-C; PX4 starts USB MAVLink itself (SYS_USB_AUTO default),
# so no MAV_x entry is used for the Pi. TELEM2 is left unchanged.
# Not included: airframe (SYS_AUTOSTART/CA_*), motor outputs, calibrations, PM07 scaling,
# hover thrust/PID. Select the airframe in QGC first; do not change it via this file.
# Measure on the real aircraft, then set in QGC:
#   EKF2_MIN_RNG = MTF-01 range reading with the aircraft standing on the floor.
#   EKF2_OF_POS_X/Y/Z, EKF2_RNG_POS_X/Y/Z = sensor offset from the centre of gravity (m).
#   SENS_FLOW_ROT: confirm by hand (move nose-forward => x grows, move right => y grows).
# CBRK_IO_SAFETY=0 requires the safety button (GPS module) before arming.
# BAT_*_THR are fractions of remaining capacity, not volts.
# QGC skips names that do not exist yet: import, reboot, import again.
# No real flight validation.
# Vehicle-Id Component-Id Name Value Type
